    "title": "Cardinal Mooney dominates to win FHSAA Class 2A state title over Bolles",
    "text": "MIAMI — The Cardinal Mooney football program waited 51 years between its first and second state championship, which came in 2023. So what was waiting an extra year for its third? The Cougars saw their one-year reign as champs end with heartbreak in the 2024 state semifinal round, and responded by burying every opponent in their path during this year’s playoffs.",
